# Mockup Studio - local Cloudflare secrets for `astro dev` / `wrangler dev`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in only what you need.
# Every key is optional: the core workflow works without any of them, and the
# UI reports an honest "not configured" state for the ones you leave empty.
#
# For the deployed Worker, do NOT put secrets here. Use Wrangler instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put PRINTIFY_API_KEY
# Secrets never ship inside `dist/`.

# Printify (https://developers.printify.com/)
# PRINTIFY_API_KEY=

# Etsy (https://www.etsy.com/developers/)
# ETSY_API_KEY=
# ETSY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# ETSY_SHOP_ID=

# AI provider (any OpenAI-compatible endpoint)
# AI_API_KEY=
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
